## 7. Memory Retrieval Configuration

### 7.1 Baseline Setup

- **Embedding Model:** `all-mpnet-base-v2` (Sentence Transformer)
- **Query:** Current instruction
- **Keys:** Episodic memory instructions
- **Default k:** 5 (achieves 96.5% gold memory recall vs. 86.1% at k=3)

### 7.2 Retrieval Strategies Comparison

| Strategy | Description | Effect |
|----------|-------------|--------|
| **Baseline** | Similarity-based top-k | Reference approach |
| **Reranker** | LLM-based pointwise reranking of 10 candidates | Reduces missing rate but doesn't improve task performance |
| **Query Expansion** | Reformulate queries before retrieval | Effectiveness depends on query quality |

**Critical Finding:** Improved retrieval does not ensure improved outcomes—semantically similar but task-irrelevant memories can harm performance.

